acious deck overlooking the lake. The fully finished basement, with a separate side entrance, includes a large recreation room, spacious bedroom, full bathroom, and plenty of storage. Upstairs you'll find a bright bonus room with beautiful lake views, primary bedroom with a large walk-in closet and ensuite, a full bathroom, and convenient upper-floor laundry. Recent updates include upgraded kitchen appliances, hot water tank. Ideally located close to all amenities, this well-maintained home offers an exceptional lakefront lifestyle in a sought-after neighbourhood. (id:67522)","facts":[["Price","$699,000"],["Type","House"],["Bedrooms","4"],["Bathrooms","4"],["Half bathrooms","1"],["Living area","2,163 sq ft"],["Lot size","5,290 sq ft"],["Year built","2004"],["Storeys","2"],["Neighbourhood","Terwillegar Towne"],["Town","Edmonton"],["Postal code","T6R3J3"],["MLS® number","E4505904"],["Listed","August 28, 2026"]],"features":[["Appliances","Washer, Refrigerator, Water softener, Dishwasher, Stove, Dryer, Garburator, Hood Fan, See remarks, Window Coverings, Garage door opener, Garage door opener remote(s)"],["Heating","Forced air"],["Basement","Finished, Full"],["Parking","Attached Garage"],["Community","Lake Privileges"]],"rooms":[["Kitchen","Main level","4.06 m × 3.03 m (13'4\" × 9'11\")"],["Den","Main level",""],["Primary Bedroom","Upper Level","4.36 m × 4.29 m (14'4\" × 14'1\")"],["Bedroom 2","Upper Level","3.43 m × 2.87 m (11'3\" × 9'5\")"],["Bedroom 3","Upper Level","3.33 m × 2.93 m (10'11\" × 9'7\")"],["Bedroom 4","Basement",""],["Bonus Room","Upper Level","4.67 m × 4.44 m (15'4\" × 14'7\")"]],"courtesy":"Robert Wu, Sterling Real Estate","board":"REALTORS® Association of Edmonton","town_slug":"edmonton","hood_slug":"terwillegar-towne","area":"southwest-edmonton"}